OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud tends to clear away   
OL,6,Ffrom the moors, with the best of the   
OL,7,Fsunny spells towards Cornwall. Breezy  
OL,8,Fat first near coasts, but becoming     
OL,9,Flighter. A chillier day than Tuesday.  
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy for some    
OL,12,Fwith clear spells elsewhere tonight.   
OL,13,FWhere skies clear, temperatures fall   
OL,14,Faway sharply with an easterly breeze   
OL,15,Fand patchy frost giving a rather       
OL,16,Fchilly feel.                           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
