OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThursday:FAfter a frosty start for     
OL,6,Fsome, Thursday will be cloudy and dry, 
OL,7,Fwith patchy rain at times towards      
OL,8,FDevon and Cornwall. Turning wetter,    
OL,9,Fwindier and milder overnight.          
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday   
OL,12,Fand the weekend will likely be         
OL,13,Funsettled with a mix of rain and cloud 
OL,14,Fbetween brighter spells, with breezy   
OL,15,Fwinds near coasts. Generally chilly    
OL,16,Finland but milder near coasts.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
